## Summary

- 72 current types collapse into the new tree. One row remains flagged: D21 Welfare needs a new home after the Medical children were pruned.
- Catch-alls (E99, D99, B99) retire in favour of the Not Final mechanism.
- The shark S-series (6 sighting types) collapses to one Type plus two Tag dimensions, the biggest single simplification in the map.
- Inactive types (C01, C02, E04, E05, G01) mapped for historical comparability only.
